    "actions": [
      "DECIDE the Service campaign's conversion goal. It is currently optimising toward WhatsApp + Call button clicks (192 of 211 'conversions'); only 19 are form leads. Either (a) that is intentional and CPL AED 372 per contact action is the KPI, or (b) revert the campaign goal to Web Form Lead only and accept a much thinner signal. Until decided, the AED 372 CPL and the AED 4,129 cost-per-form-lead are both misleading on their own.",
      "Persist gclid + landing-page path with every lead in Supabase (code change in /api/lead) so WhatsApp/Call clicks can be reconciled against real conversations. Right now we cannot tell how many of the 192 contact clicks became leads.",
      "Weekly CPL has drifted from ~AED 290-310 (late Jul / early Aug) to AED 470-590 (last 3 weeks) on flat spend. Set a Target CPA guardrail now: bidding is Maximize Conversions with no cap and avg CPC is AED 50 (some terms AED 90-430/click). Start tCPA at ~AED 400 (10% above the 90-day achieved AED 372), tighten <=15% every 2-3 weeks.",
